        "params": {
          "text": "G2 TWO-NODE AUDIO EQUALIZER (48 kHz)\nNode A (source): log sweep 20 Hz-20 kHz for 10 s, then tones at 100, 400, 1600, 6000 and 12000 Hz.\nNode B (equalizer): bundled AudioEqualizer, gains +6/0/-9/+3/-6 dB; records input and output.\nDeploy: tools/run_g2_audio_demo.py (two nodes) or Studio Deploy. Run in Studio = the same graph locally;\nit writes record_in.s7b and record_out.s7b into Studio's working directory. examples/audio/two_node_equalizer.md",
